---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Tentang Redaksi & Manifesto — LUXIMA MAGAZINE" activeNav="about">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 pt-8 pb-24">
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <span
        class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-[#a88857] font-semibold"
        >Dewan Redaksi</span
      >
      <h1
        class="font-editorial text-4xl sm:text-6xl text-[#1A1A1A] font-semibold mt-2"
      >
        About LUXIMA Magazine
      </h1>
      <p
        class="text-base text-neutral-600 font-light mt-4 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mx-auto"
      >
        Media kurasi pernikahan mewah pertama yang menggabungkan keindahan
        visual editorial, teknologi modern, dan etika jurnalisme independen.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Manifesto -->
    <div
      class="glass-panel rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-12 border border-[#a88857]/30 mb-16 space-y-6 text-sm text-neutral-700 font-light leading-relaxed"
    >
      <h3 class="font-editorial text-3xl text-[#1A1A1A] font-semibold">
        The LUXIMA Manifesto
      </h3>
      <p class="editorial-dropcap">
        Kami percaya bahwa hari pernikahan adalah perayaan monumental yang
        melampaui sekadar tradisi seremonial. Di era modern, pernikahan adalah
        kanvas estetika di mana cinta, seni, dan kepribadian berpadu menjadi
        sebuah narasi abadi.
      </p>
      <p>
        LUXIMA Magazine hadir untuk menjadi kompas terpercaya bagi pasangan yang
        mengapresiasi kemewahan sejati: kehalusan detail, keanggunan tanpa
        paksaan, dan pengalaman yang tak terlupakan bagi setiap insan yang
        hadir.
      </p>
    </div>

        <!-- Masthead Team Grid (Aligned with LUXIMA / awedz Executive Leadership) -->
    <section class="mb-16">
      <h3
        class="font-editorial text-3xl text-[#1A1A1A] font-semibold text-center mb-10"
      >
        Editorial & Leadership Board
      </h3>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <div class="glass-card rounded-2xl p-6 text-center group hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-500 border border-[#a88857]/30">
          <img
            src="https://r2.luxima.id/cdn-cgi/image/width=600,quality=85,format=auto/angga.jpg"
            alt="Angga Bagastama"
            onerror="this.onerror=null; this.src='/assets/avatar-fallback.svg';"
            class="w-24 h-24 rounded-full object-cover mx-auto mb-4 border-2 border-[#a88857] group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500 shadow-md"
          />
          <h5 class="font-editorial text-xl font-semibold text-[#1A1A1A]">
            Angga Bagastama
          </h5>
          <p
            class="text-[10px] text-[#a88857] uppercase tracking-widest font-semibold mt-1"
          >
            Marketing Director & Co-Founder
          </p>
          <p class="text-xs text-neutral-500 font-light mt-2 leading-relaxed">
            Merancang narasi editorial pernikahan mewah dengan kemurnian estetika dan visi komersial berskala nasional.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="glass-card rounded-2xl p-6 text-center group hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-500 border border-[#a88857]/30">
          <img
            src="https://r2.luxima.id/cdn-cgi/image/width=600,quality=85,format=auto/me.jpg"
            alt="Siddiq Achmad"
            onerror="this.onerror=null; this.src='/assets/avatar-fallback.svg';"
            class="w-24 h-24 rounded-full object-cover mx-auto mb-4 border-2 border-[#a88857] group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500 shadow-md"
          />
          <h5 class="font-editorial text-xl font-semibold text-[#1A1A1A]">
            Siddiq Achmad
          </h5>
          <p
            class="text-[10px] text-[#a88857] uppercase tracking-widest font-semibold mt-1"
          >
            Founder & Editor-in-Chief
          </p>
          <p class="text-xs text-neutral-500 font-light mt-2 leading-relaxed">
            Mengarahkan arsitektur sistem digital dan standar kurasi jurnalisme mewah untuk merayakan kesakralan upacara adat Nusantara.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="glass-card rounded-2xl p-6 text-center group hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-500 border border-[#a88857]/30">
          <img
            src="https://r2.luxima.id/cdn-cgi/image/width=600,quality=85,format=auto/Helmi.jpg"
            alt="Suhelmi"
            onerror="this.onerror=null; this.src='/assets/avatar-fallback.svg';"
            class="w-24 h-24 rounded-full object-cover mx-auto mb-4 border-2 border-[#a88857] group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500 shadow-md"
          />
          <h5 class="font-editorial text-xl font-semibold text-[#1A1A1A]">
            Suhelmi
          </h5>
          <p
            class="text-[10px] text-[#a88857] uppercase tracking-widest font-semibold mt-1"
          >
            Managing Director & Partnership
          </p>
          <p class="text-xs text-neutral-500 font-light mt-2 leading-relaxed">
            Menghubungkan ekosistem artisan pernikahan elit dan destinasi suaka eksklusif dalam lingkaran kemitraan LUXIMA.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Submissions & Inquiries -->
    <section
      class="glass-panel rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-12 border border-[#a88857]/30 text-center"
    >
      <span
        class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-[#a88857] font-semibold"
        >Kemitraan & Pengajuan</span
      >
      <h3 class="font-editorial text-3xl text-[#1A1A1A] font-semibold mt-1">
        Press & Submissions Office
      </h3>
      <p
        class="text-xs text-neutral-600 font-light mt-3 max-w-md mx-auto leading-relaxed"
      >
        Fotografer, perancang gaun, atau vendor pernikahan yang ingin mengajukan
        liputan editorial dapat menghubungi dewan redaksi kami.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4">
        <a
          href="mailto:editorial@luxima.id"
          class="px-6 py-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#1A1A1A] text-white text-xs uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold hover:bg-[#a88857] transition-all"
        >
          editorial@luxima.id
        </a>
        <a
          href="mailto:press@luxima.id"
          class="px-6 py-2.5 rounded-full border border-neutral-300 text-neutral-700 text-xs uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold hover:border-[#a88857] transition-all"
        >
          press@luxima.id
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>
